    `the person is a representative in relation to dealing in capital markets products that are securities or contracts under this Act, or an exempt person, within section 2(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a representative, in relation to dealing in capital markets products that are securities or securities-based derivatives contracts under the Securities and Futures Act 2001 or an exempt person, within the meaning given by section 2(1) of this Act?
    `the person is a representative in relation to advising on any investment product under the Financial Advisers Act 2001 or an exempt financial adviser, within section 2(1) of that Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a representative, in relation to advising on any investment product under the Financial Advisers Act 2001 or an exempt financial adviser, within the meaning given by section 2(1) of that Act?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F42 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 251(18A) "representative" the person is a representative` MEANS
