    `what section 252(1) answers for the person` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 252(1) the person has notified the person making the offer` answer for the person? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
-- FORK F43 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 252(2) the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
